<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 153 0 R
/E (extracts all the named characters, works out which characters interact most with each other, maps out the nature of those relationships \(allied, hostile, romantic, etc.\), and builds an interactive visual network graph you can actually explore. The system uses spaCy for the base NLP work and Google's Gemini API for the parts that need real semantic understanding, like figuring out whether "the young solicitor" and "Jonathan Harker" are)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
