/E (Considering an unstructured literary text \(T\), the main problem is to develop a computational pipeline that identifies the important characters \(C = {c_1,c_2,\\ldots,c_n}\), identifies the protagonist, constructs a relationship graph using an adjacency matrix, and assigns contextual relationship scores between -1.0 \(hostile\) and +1.0 \(friendly\). The system also aims to generate meaningful summaries and genre classifications while targeting an F1-score above 85%.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
