/T (Lit Mind utilizes an architecture for an NLP processing pipeline that integrates deterministic pre-processing, LLM-based semantic extraction, and statistical graph models. Its modular nature guarantees the rapid processing of literary texts, while each step of the pipeline can be independently tested and optimized.)
