/E (The normalization pipeline works on the documents in this order: Normalize all line endings to use the UNIX line ending \\n. Remove Project Gutenberg license header and footer via regexes. Remove hard- line break encodings, so Hel-\\nsing has the same meaning as Helsing. Rejoin hard-wrapped lines in paragraphs \(removing the line break\). \(Removing the paragraph does not change the paragraph structure, so paragraph tokens can be used later to join up the lines \(span boundaries\) in sentences.\) However, spaCy's sentence detector does not like hard wrapped lines, as it expects all formatting to be normal prose punctuation. If this step is not included, spaCy will generate a sentence at the end of every)
/Pg 26 0 R
